      "en": "She gives no thought to the way of life. Her ways are crooked, and she doesn’t know it.",
      "ko": "그는 생명의 평탄한 길을 찾지 못하며 자기 길이 든든치 못하여도 그것을 깨닫지 못하느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "2b6e9bcd0e3f01c2bdd6c5c8cad07df170408ed88ddbd042a1b3c154d338057b",
      "translation_text_hash": "26ca548b5e641720e3c23e8cf2c843aeed080834ea75abf4291354074d060a5d",
