      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PRO",
          "chapter": 5,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "Now therefore, my sons, listen to me. Don’t depart from the words of my mouth.",
      "ko": "그런즉 아들들아 나를 들으며 내 입의 말을 버리지 말고",
      "source_text_hash": "c07762c0d095ffe7bb44aa86ef38c457a4e4707b0289c7ffb510ca4b1621e783",
      "translation_text_hash": "9fc33f5cbed7f43bc7d74b5d6f2d4db9a9cf2188d1bbf76621b9d836e000609d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
